WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.323
Hear the Christmas carols.

2
00:00:09.324 --> 00:00:11.526
See the twinkling lights.

3
00:00:11.527 --> 00:00:18.866
It's the Christmas season!

4
00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:23.307
Hana: Mom, Christmas is just around the corner.

5
00:00:23.308 --> 00:00:25.113
Mom: Yes, dear.

6
00:00:25.114 --> 00:00:27.967
Bada: I can't wait to for Santa to come.

7
00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:33.826
He will give me a nice present.

8
00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:36.109
Dad: What do you wish to get?

9
00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:41.916
Bada: Well, this year, since I have been such a good boy . . .

10
00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:46.786
Bada: I wished for a nice pair of rollerblades.

11
00:00:46.787 --> 00:00:51.662
Dad: Hmm. Really? I see . . .

12
00:00:51.663 --> 00:00:53.922
Bada: What about you, Hana?

13
00:00:53.923 --> 00:00:56.633
What did you ask for?

14
00:00:56.634 --> 00:00:59.262
Hana: I asked for a mini camera.

15
00:00:59.263 --> 00:01:02.291
I like to take pictures.

16
00:01:02.292 --> 00:01:10.046
Dad: Boy, Santa will need to work very hard this year.

17
00:01:10.047 --> 00:01:12.446
Hana: Done! Bada, quick!

18
00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:14.487
Turn off the light!

19
00:01:14.488 --> 00:01:18.601
Bada: Okay, here we go.

20
00:01:18.602 --> 00:01:25.547
Everyone: Wow! It's beautiful!

21
00:01:25.548 --> 00:01:31.813
Santa Claus brings happiness to us all!
